Subject: [PATCH 2/4] BlueOS: Charging sounds: Unplug, battery full and low
 battery sounds

One picker per event. The unplug and battery full sounds are played by frameworks/base (BlueOS patch), low battery by SystemUI. Defaults are the BlueOS Emoticon sounds.

Change-Id: Iaa2060062a02c872c0c166a7fc2da42f6df87077
